  "description": "This planning application relates to 34 Mount Road and seeks permission for the construction of a single-storey rear extension measuring 6 metres in depth. The extension is designed to provide additional living space that improves the functionality and usability of the property for modern family needs.\n\nThe proposed extension will run across the width of the rear elevation and project 6 metres into the garden. It will be constructed using materials that match the existing dwelling, ensuring the new addition is sympathetic in scale, proportion, and character to the original house. The design respects neighbouring properties and has been carefully considered to minimise any impact on residential amenity, outlook, or natural light.",
